    "steam_appid": 3106160,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h1>Notice to customers outside of Japan:</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please be aware that there are some content differences between the version of A Train 9 v5 released in your region, and the version released in Japan.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Introducing A-Train 9 v5</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The genre-defining fusion of transport simulator and city builder is back in its ultimate form!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3106160/extras/040ca23b314d1de56b649241f26b81a3.poster.avif?t=1750924237\" width=616 height=347 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3106160/extras/040ca23b314d1de56b649241f26b81a3.webm?t=1750924237\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome, Mr President</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the president of an up-and-coming railroad company, it\u2019s your job to build a matchless transport network that will provide the cornerstone to a flourishing city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First, begin by laying down track in a region you feel has potential. Do you prefer the mountains, the coast, or perhaps lakeside? Or would you like to reconstruct and potentially improve upon a real-life city? With 60 scenarios to choose from, there\u2019s masses of replayability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3106160/extras/84e1efe58d0408f3fa62bb9e02475e92.avif?t=1750924237\" width=600 height=276 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the city begins to grow organically around your network, guide and shape it into your personal utopian metropolis.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Affect the growth of each district by deciding which buildings to manually construct. Choose from 500 different types!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use powerful landscaping tools to flatten obstacles, redirect rivers or just make the city nice\u2019n hilly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optimise the type of trains (97 varieties included!), their top speed and the timetables they run to, for maximum efficiency.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3106160/extras/98d748769f4bd9540d11287351fcda2f.poster.avif?t=1750924237\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3106160/extras/98d748769f4bd9540d11287351fcda2f.webm?t=1750924237\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3106160/extras/98d748769f4bd9540d11287351fcda2f.mp4?t=1750924237\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Catch A Ride</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your city is shaping up well, so this is the perfect time for sitting around!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sit in the driver\u2019s seat or passenger seat of one of the many trains bustling around your city and experience firsthand just how good (or bad!) your railway really is to ride on.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sit in the passenger seat of a car driving through the city, or a boat in the harbor, and relax as you take in the sights.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or take a birds\u2019-eye view to get the really big picture.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3106160/extras/dea0ff07e6a4a310ca150c040a51734f.poster.avif?t=1750924237\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3106160/extras/dea0ff07e6a4a310ca150c040a51734f.webm?t=1750924237\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3106160/extras/dea0ff07e6a4a310ca150c040a51734f.mp4?t=1750924237\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What\u2019s New?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New features include \u201cSwitchyards\u201d, \u201cTrain Turnstiles\u201d, and \u201cRailway Couplings\u201d for added realism!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3106160/extras/65b652978a44ab48d0e7feb9a502aaee.avif?t=1750924237\" width=600 height=276 /></span></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Introducing A-Train 9 v5</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The genre-defining fusion of transport simulator and city builder is back in its ultimate form!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3106160/extras/040ca23b314d1de56b649241f26b81a3.poster.avif?t=1750924237\" width=616 height=347 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3106160/extras/040ca23b314d1de56b649241f26b81a3.webm?t=1750924237\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome, Mr President</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the president of an up-and-coming railroad company, it\u2019s your job to build a matchless transport network that will provide the cornerstone to a flourishing city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First, begin by laying down track in a region you feel has potential. Do you prefer the mountains, the coast, or perhaps lakeside? Or would you like to reconstruct and potentially improve upon a real-life city? With 60 scenarios to choose from, there\u2019s masses of replayability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3106160/extras/84e1efe58d0408f3fa62bb9e02475e92.avif?t=1750924237\" width=600 height=276 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the city begins to grow organically around your network, guide and shape it into your personal utopian metropolis.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Affect the growth of each district by deciding which buildings to manually construct. Choose from 500 different types!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use powerful landscaping tools to flatten obstacles, redirect rivers or just make the city nice\u2019n hilly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optimise the type of trains (97 varieties included!), their top speed and the timetables they run to, for maximum efficiency.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3106160/extras/98d748769f4bd9540d11287351fcda2f.poster.avif?t=1750924237\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3106160/extras/98d748769f4bd9540d11287351fcda2f.webm?t=1750924237\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3106160/extras/98d748769f4bd9540d11287351fcda2f.mp4?t=1750924237\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Catch A Ride</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your city is shaping up well, so this is the perfect time for sitting around!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sit in the driver\u2019s seat or passenger seat of one of the many trains bustling around your city and experience firsthand just how good (or bad!) your railway really is to ride on.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sit in the passenger seat of a car driving through the city, or a boat in the harbor, and relax as you take in the sights.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or take a birds\u2019-eye view to get the really big picture.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3106160/extras/dea0ff07e6a4a310ca150c040a51734f.poster.avif?t=1750924237\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3106160/extras/dea0ff07e6a4a310ca150c040a51734f.webm?t=1750924237\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3106160/extras/dea0ff07e6a4a310ca150c040a51734f.mp4?t=1750924237\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What\u2019s New?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New features include \u201cSwitchyards\u201d, \u201cTrain Turnstiles\u201d, and \u201cRailway Couplings\u201d for added realism!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3106160/extras/65b652978a44ab48d0e7feb9a502aaee.avif?t=1750924237\" width=600 height=276 /></span></p></li></ul>",
